# Allow-list: the image needs the project, its workspace packages, the lock, the migrations
# (under src/), and what `coverset seed-demo` / `coverset replay` read
# (scripts/, examples/demo-*, fixtures/). Everything else (docs images, tests, the TypeScript
# packages, node_modules, local data and secrets) stays out of the build context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!alembic.ini
!src/
!packages/coverset-model/
!packages/pytest-coverset/
!scripts/
!examples/demo-app/
!examples/demo-prs/
!fixtures/

# Never ship local state, caches or secrets, even inside allowed directories.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.hypothesis
**/.coverset
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets
**/*.pem
**/*.key
packages/*/tests
